---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/common/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/common/Footer.astro';
import FloatingWhatsApp from '../../components/common/FloatingWhatsApp.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';

const pageTitle = "Lead Magnet Launchpad Service | Apex Content Lab";
const pageDescription = "A professional service by Apex Content Lab to research, design, build, and connect high-converting lead magnets to a functional lead-generation system.";
const canonicalUrl = `${siteConfig.url}/services/lead-magnet-launchpad`;
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-grow">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/40 via-white to-white py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6 text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-apex-blue,#2563EB)]">
          <span>Growth Systems Service</span>
          <span class="text-blue-300">•</span>
          <span>Lead Generation Infrastructure</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-[1.15]">
          Lead Magnet <span class="text-[var(--color-apex-blue,#2563EB)]">Launchpad</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          A structured professional service that helps your business research audience pain points, build high-value lead magnets, connect opt-in funnels, and establish automated follow-up systems that turn visitors into qualified leads.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href={siteConfig.routes.bookCall}
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-apex-blue,#2563EB)] px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Book Strategy Call
          </a>
          <a
            href="/services"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-gray-300 bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base font-medium text-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors"
          >
            View All Services
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Main Content Body */}
    <section class="py-16 bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

        {/* Clear Standalone Definition for GEO/AI */}
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50/50 border border-blue-100 space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">What is a Lead Magnet Launchpad?</h2>
          <p class="text-sm">
            <strong>A Lead Magnet Launchpad</strong> is a structured professional service provided by Apex Content Lab that helps a business identify a high-value audience problem, create an appropriate lead magnet, connect it to an opt-in process, deliver it through email, and establish follow-up that can turn subscribers into qualified opportunities.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* The Problem Section */}
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">The Problem: Why Most Lead Magnets Fail</h2>
          <p>
            Many businesses invest time and budget into creating PDFs, checklists, guides, or video resources, yet experience disappointing opt-in conversion rates or fail to generate actual customers. 
          </p>
          <p>
            This typically happens because the asset solves a generic problem rather than a specific, urgent pain point for a defined buyer. Furthermore, businesses often publish lead magnets as isolated files without connecting them to an integrated email nurture sequence, CRM tracking, or automated follow-up system. Without a complete growth system, transient attention evaporates instead of becoming pipeline.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* What the Service Does & Methodology */}
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">The Complete Implementation Process</h2>
          <p>
            As a Growth Systems Company, Apex Content Lab approaches lead generation as an engineered infrastructure project rather than a one-off graphic design task. Our implementation process includes:
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/50 space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">1. Audience & Problem Research</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Identifying high-friction customer pain points and determining the precise angle that commands attention.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/50 space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">2. Strategy & Positioning</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Structuring the exact deliverable format, title, and promise to maximize opt-in conversion rates.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/50 space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">3. Asset Development</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Drafting or refining the core educational framework, templates, or tactical resource.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/50 space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">4. Opt-In & Delivery Flow</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Connecting landing pages, form capture, automated email delivery, and subsequent nurture sequences.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Distinguishing Offerings */}
        <div class="space-y-6 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Understanding Our Offerings</h2>
          <p class="text-sm">
            To ensure complete clarity, it is important to distinguish between our educational materials and our professional implementation services:
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">1. Free Attention-to-Leads Blueprint (<a href="/resources" class="text-blue-600 underline">Resources</a>)</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">A complimentary educational resource designed to introduce visitors to our foundational concepts and convert them into subscribers.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">2. Paid Lead Magnet Blueprint (<a href="/products" class="text-blue-600 underline">Products</a>)</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">A digital product containing actionable frameworks, templates, and swipe files for founders who want to build their lead magnets independently.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">3. Lead Magnet Launchpad (<a href="/services/lead-magnet-launchpad" class="text-blue-600 underline">Service</a>)</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">A done-with-you or done-for-you professional service where Apex Content Lab engineers the complete lead-generation infrastructure on your behalf.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Who It Is For / Not For */}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base">Who This Service Is For</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-gray-600">
              <li>• B2B founders and service providers looking for predictable lead generation.</li>
              <li>• Businesses with active web traffic or social attention that fails to convert into email subscribers.</li>
              <li>• Companies wanting automated infrastructure rather than manual follow-up.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base">Who This Is NOT For</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-gray-600">
              <li>• Businesses looking for generic social media posting or vanity follower growth.</li>
              <li>• Companies searching for cheap, instantaneous shortcuts without a sound strategy.</li>
              <li>• Organizations not ready to handle inbound lead conversations.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* FAQ Section */}
        <div class="space-y-6 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-6 text-sm">
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base">What is a Lead Magnet Launchpad?</h3>
              <p>It is a professional service by Apex Content Lab that designs, builds, and connects high-value lead magnets to automated email and conversion infrastructure.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base">How does a lead magnet connect to email marketing?</h3>
              <p>When a visitor submits their email to receive the lead magnet, the system immediately delivers the asset via an automated email and triggers a multi-step nurture sequence designed to build trust and prompt further engagement.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base">Should I build a lead magnet myself or hire someone?</h3>
              <p>If you prefer a self-guided approach, our paid <a href="/products" class="text-blue-600 underline">Lead Magnet Blueprint</a> provides the templates. If you want a fully engineered system built and connected for you, the Lead Magnet Launchpad service is appropriate.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base">What happens after the lead magnet is launched?</h3>
              <p>Once live, your lead magnet continuously captures visitor information from your traffic channels, feeding subscribers into your automated nurture system and creating regular opportunities for strategy calls or sales conversations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Bottom CTA Box */}
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gray-900 text-white space-y-4 text-center my-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Ready to Launch Your Lead Generation System?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto">
            Book a strategy session to discuss how we can engineer a custom lead magnet system for your business.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
            <a
              href={siteConfig.routes.bookCall}
              class="rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-apex-blue,#2563EB)] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors"
            >
              Book Strategy Call
            </a>
            <a
              href="/framework/what-is-marketing-infrastructure"
              class="rounded-xl bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors"
            >
              Read Our Framework Guide
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
  <FloatingWhatsApp />
</BaseLayout>
